# Exemptions for scripts/check-names.sh. Every entry needs a reason (the last
# column). Keep this list short: each entry is a known leak that is either a
# record of provenance or waits for a decision that is not this repo's to make.
#
# kind	pattern	reason
file	CHANGELOG.md	release history: names of past releases and their products
file	docs/provenance.md	record of where generic code came from and the cross-repo migration
file	scripts/check-names.sh	the checker's own product-name list
file	scripts/check-names.allow	this allowlist
token	bcm2712-rpi-cm5-cm5io	upstream Raspberry Pi kernel device tree name that the sensor bridge build applies overlays to (a file the kernel builds, not a product)
